adding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\"><b>Pulse oximetry reading</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccd8e0; padding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\">89% on room air</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccd8e0; padding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\">92% on 2 L/min NC</td></tr></tbody></table>"
